  "articleBody": "Before requesting proposals for a living room addition, assemble property information, define how the room must function, and prepare questions about design, permits, construction, and final inspection. A useful preparation package helps the contractor identify site constraints early, price the same scope, and explain which decisions may affect the project’s complexity.",
